Brad,

How about a little harmless subversion? If U. of Waterloo won't accept
rec.humor.funny via the net, how about donating a couple copies
of the 1990 rec.humor.funny book? One of the main library and
one for the computer science library.

Librarians, unlike some net.administrators, tend to understand the importance
of the freedom to read. Specifically, most libraries will gladly accept
any book that you are kind enough to donate. A donation from a local
publisher should be especially appreciated.

- Carl


