U.S. Representative Hyde, a conservative Republican, is proposing a
bill that would protect so-called hate speech on college campuses. The
ACLU, a group that is almost never on the same side of an issue as
Hyde, supports this bill.

[The bill would protect speech even on private campuses, unless there
were religious reasons for the suppression.]

--
