 |VIC 3053, Australia     | Internet:hal@mel.dit.csiro.au                 |

=====================================================
Welcome to the index that will help you to find Supreme Court decisions!

Index includes

      -  file location [directory] and file name
      -  identifying line for case 
      -  keywords


For example:
    
    File 
    location/
    filename    Case and parts; keywords
    ---------   ------------------------------------------------
    1989term/   TEXACO INC. v. HASBROUCK:  s, o, c1, c2
    87-2048     Clayton Act; distributors; discounts; retail market;
                gasoline         

Explanation:

         1989term/    -  file will be found 1989 sub-directory
         87-2048      -  87-2048 is actual filename (Dockett number)

         first line   -  offical case name; abbreviated parts in decision

         middle lines -  keywords; identifying words taken from case
               

Key to abbreviation of parts in decision:
-----------------------------------------
s     syllabus         cd     concurring in part dissenting in part
o     opinion          o1     appendix to opinion
c     concurring       od     combined opinion and dissent 
d     dissenting       orig   Original Jurisdiction
                        
___________________________________________________________________________
