References: <1993Apr7.165210.9928@midway.uchicago.edu> <1993Apr10.233453.27018@midway.uchicago.edu> <1993Apr11.015851.15040@eff.org> <1993Apr11.021410.1822@midway.uchicago.edu>
Distribution: usa
